WEBVTT

00:20:29.204 --> 00:20:30.204
I have a question for you.

00:20:31.288 --> 00:20:36.371
Do you think it could be helpful for us
to dig in around what happened as

00:20:36.371 --> 00:20:38.996
a group? What I'm seeing, as

00:20:38.996 --> 00:20:42.413
I think people are making up different
stories about how we ended up in this

00:20:42.413 --> 00:20:46.204
setback, and I wonder if it'd
be helpful if we sat down

00:20:46.454 --> 00:20:51.163
and just talked through it so we could get
on the same page and figure out just

00:20:51.163 --> 00:20:54.246
as a group what went wrong so we
could embed that in our team

00:20:54.246 --> 00:20:55.371
and not repeat it.

00:20:57.038 --> 00:20:59.204
So I would just practice the work.